    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107783" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερπαίω</span></b> , mostly used in pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πέπαικα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overstrike, surpass,
			exceed,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολὺ δ᾽ ὑπερπέπαικεν τούτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					1118
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσοῦτον ὑπερπέπαικας πλούτῳ τοὺς
					ἄλλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					50.34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				14.5.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				1.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Im.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristocl.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				15.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				7.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.32P.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -παίοντα χρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					3.509
				</span></i>
			 (Thrace, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>).</div>
